[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8161.31, "timestamp": "02:16:01", "text": "这一点更多地体现在我接下来要说的话中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8164.069, "timestamp": "02:16:04", "text": "啊，我不知道。它叫《传说》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8165.83, "timestamp": "02:16:05", "text": "主。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8168.39, "timestamp": "02:16:08", "text": "领主之刃的传说。哦，对，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8171.03, "timestamp": "02:16:11", "text": "听起来像13岁小孩的水平。相信我，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8186.96, "timestamp": "02:16:26", "text": "对，那是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.91, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8192.07, "timestamp": "02:16:32", "text": "电视节目呢？你一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8194.15, "timestamp": "02:16:34", "text": "已更新所有 Netflix 节目或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8197.07, "timestamp": "02:16:37", "text": "任何事物？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8201.03, "timestamp": "02:16:41", "text": "嗯，Netflix的剧集。呃，我看到了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8202.629, "timestamp": "02:16:42", "text": "我偶尔会和他们联系，但我不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8204.79, "timestamp": "02:16:44", "text": "真的有时间把所有东西都看完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8207.19, "timestamp": "02:16:47", "text": "因为它们时长都差不多1小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8210.95, "timestamp": "02:16:50", "text": "你知道。是的，确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8213.91, "timestamp": "02:16:53", "text": "所以，这需要付出巨大的努力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8215.99, "timestamp": "02:16:55", "text": "你就坐在那儿，看着这一切发生。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8219.349, "timestamp": "02:16:59", "text": "我想看《这是什么游戏》"}]